    "long_instructions": "##Rubric Reviewer\r\n\r\nThis AI Chat will review your guide and check how well it meets the project rubric criteria.\r\n\r\n**Do This**: \r\n\r\n1. Click Add File and choose From Library.\r\n2. Select Project Checklist.\r\n3. Add the sketch of your guide from the Backpack.\r\n4. Ask the Rubric Reviewer to check your guide against the rubric.\r\n5. Read the feedback carefully and decide what you actually want to change.",
